{
  "$description": "Brand tokens: the primitives every other tier refers to. Colour ramps, faces and the scales for type, space, radius, shadow and motion. Nothing outside this repository should name a brand colour directly; it names the semantic token that says what the colour is for. The first level of every path is its category; the rest is the token's name.",
